                                                "sense_id": "dccc7798-3394-31e5-ae5f-0d05f1ba7bc6",
                                                "text": "On the second operation the 1,000 mortar bombs were parachuted into the LZ on 125 chutes; all were on target but two roman candled which sent everyone diving for cover and necessitated the change of some knickers."
